  "description": "*“Long time no see, Laila. My maid.”*\n\nLaila, the maid who was the daughter of a brothel. Leopold, the king's abandoned bastard son. Their childhood first love for each other was tender, yet simultaneously became an indelible wound for both. Years passed, and they met again under false identities. Love and hatred, obsession and contradiction—these conflicting emotions reignite like sparks. The first love they tried to erase but could never let go now threatens to consume them both...\n\nThe dangerous reunion of the noble princess and the war hero. What awaits them at the end? Mutual ruin or destiny?\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
